		"viz_ag_sourcetype_howto": {
			"type": "splunk.markdown",
			"options": {
				"markdown": "### How to Update a Macro\n\n1. Find the index for your sourcetype:\n ```\n | tstats count where index=*\n sourcetype=\"<yours>\" by index\n ```\n2. Note the index name(s) returned\n3. In Splunk Web go to:\n **Settings > Advanced Search > Search Macros**\n - Filter by App: `splunk-cisco-dashboards`\n - Click the macro (e.g. `index_network`)\n - Change **Definition** to:\n ```\n index IN (idx1, idx2)\n ```\n - Click **Save**\n4. Changes take effect immediately"
			}
		},
